{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 360,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is Linus from Linus Tech Tips"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2670,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we hacked the phone\nnetwork in order to spy on him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5730,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's pretty messed up Derek."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7680,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I slept easier not knowing that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9720,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We intercepted his phone calls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11850,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and stole his two-factor passcodes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14430,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that your number Linus?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15840,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, but I didn't get,\nmine didn't even ring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19800,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We didn't touch his phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21240,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We didn't send him an\nemail or a text, nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24360,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We did it all remotely\nand the worst part is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27500,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it could happen to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28980,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think I'm really\nsurprised that, no offense,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32100,
    "dDurationMs": 1596,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but like you guys did it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33696,
    "dDurationMs": 1314,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Derek Laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35010,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, you're not a career\ncriminal hacker mastermind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38370,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "necessarily.\n- No, indeed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40020,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But here it is, a normal looking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42090,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and feeling device with no,\nyou know, obvious problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46260,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with it and you just receive my call"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50370,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of me receiving it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52020,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just what, like on command?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53310,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just, it's an app on\nyour computer or what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55380,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't even know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56400,
    "dDurationMs": 2646,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But before we explain\nhow we did all that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59046,
    "dDurationMs": 4554,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat music)\n(crowd clapping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63600,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first startup that Steve Jobs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65250,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Steve Wozniak made wasn't Apple?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67650,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, they were tackling\na different problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70380,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One where their product\nwas actually illegal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73170,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So back in the 1970s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75000,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "long distance phone calls\nwere really expensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77970,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adjusted for inflation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79170,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a call from New York to London\ncould run you $25 a minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83400,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these two entrepreneurs\ncreated a little blue box"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86730,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what it did was it\nhacked the telephone network."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90330,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They could trick the telephone\ncompany into connecting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92460,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the calls for free among other things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95310,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We were young and what we learned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98670,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was that we could build\nsomething ourselves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104670,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could control\nbillions of dollars worth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109440,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of infrastructure in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111810,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think there would've\never been an Apple computer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114330,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had there not been Blue Box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116280,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Interviewer] Woz said\nyou called the Pope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117720,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, we did call the pope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118770,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Woz pretended to be Henry Kissinger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121290,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we got the number of the Vatican"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122430,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we called the Pope and\nthey started waking people up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124560,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the hierarchy, you know,\nI don't know, cardinals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127440,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they actually sent someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129390,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to wake up the Pope when finally\nwe just burst out laughing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133260,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they realized that we\nweren't Henry Kissinger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136470,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But how were they able to do all of this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138780,
    "dDurationMs": 4287,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with one electronic box\nmade from Radio Shack parts?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143067,
    "dDurationMs": 1413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(telephone ringing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144480,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until the mid-1920s, most\nphones had no way of dialing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149010,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When your phone was on the hook,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150450,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about 48 volts was connected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the exchange to your phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154590,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then when you lifted the receiver,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156030,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an internal circuit connected the speaker"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158100,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and microphone drawing power"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160230,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that caused the voltage\nto drop to around 10 volts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163260,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at the telephone\nexchange this drop turned on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166140,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a light bulb alerting the\noperator who would then pick up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169260,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ask who you're calling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171060,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Sarah] Boston."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172230,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Sarah, get me the Bluebird Diner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174870,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And after consulting a directory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would connect a\nwire between your line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178590,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and your friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179850,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Manually connecting calls\nwas labor intensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183120,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Operators had to handle hundreds\nof connections per hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186600,
    "dDurationMs": 1657,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1910, one pundit said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188257,
    "dDurationMs": 1403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Soon the telephone system will need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189660,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to employ every working age woman"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191640,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the country as an operator.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194220,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 1950, there were more than a million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196620,
    "dDurationMs": 1653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of them in the US alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199260,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To reduce costs, companies sought"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201090,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to automate the call connection process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203310,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and one solution was the\nrotary dial telephone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206700,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To use it, you place your\nfinger in a number hole,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209100,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rotate it to the end and\nthe dial rotates back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213210,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and on the inside a metal\ndisc with ridge's turns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217200,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each ridge pushes two\nmetal plates into contact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220110,
    "dDurationMs": 2613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "completing the circuit to the exchange."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223590,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The dial sends pulses\nto match each number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226710,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the number two, it sends two pulses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229230,
    "dDurationMs": 2673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the number three\nit sends three pulses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233340,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This goes on up to 10\npulses for the number zero,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236670,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why zero is at\nthe far end of the dial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238950,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of beside the one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241230,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those pulses that travel down\nthe phone line, they determine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244260,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how your line is connected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246240,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they're known as control signals,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248760,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but as the length of the\ntransmission line was increased,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251400,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so did its capacitance and resistance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253710,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this caused the clear input\nsignals to become distorted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256860,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "smoothing out voltage changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258990,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now the pulses couldn't trigger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261000,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the switching at the exchange."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262830,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While this wasn't a\nproblem for local calls,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264750,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it made automating long\ndistance almost impossible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268050,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now all phone lines including\nlong distance ones were built"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271020,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to carry sounds in the human voice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and hearing range, mainly\nfrom 300 to 3,400 Hertz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278130,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why not use this built-in capability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280590,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to carry control signals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282480,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To do this, phone companies\nintroduced the touch tone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286020,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or push button telephone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288330,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On a keypad,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289440,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "specific frequencies were\nassigned to the horizontal axis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293160,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the vertical axis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295050,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that each button was\nuniquely identifiable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298170,
    "dDurationMs": 2226,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the combination of two tones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300396,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(buttons beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306990,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By sending control signals\nwithin the voice band,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309660,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all telephone networks could receive it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311580,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using their existing systems\nindependent of distance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315330,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with this innovation\ncame an opportunity for jobs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318720,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Wozniak to exploit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321000,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you made a long distance\ncall, it was first routed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324090,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a central node."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325980,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This node communicated with a remote node"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328650,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they determined if a line was free,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330420,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by checking whether both sides"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332190,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were sending a 2600 Hertz tone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336210,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Jobs and Woz exploited this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339000,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, they would dial\na toll free 1-800 number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342120,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which would get them into a local node"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344640,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they would send a\n2600 hertz tone into the phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349830,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This would trick the remote node"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351870,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into thinking the call\nhad been disconnected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354450,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the remote node would start\nplaying the 2600 hertz tone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357600,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "again, but Jobs and Woz\nwere still on the line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361320,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when they stopped playing\nthe tone on their side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363840,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the remote node assumed a\nnew call was being placed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366900,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By sending a key pulse tone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369060,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "followed by the desired phone number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370860,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ending with a start\ntone, they could connect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374280,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to any long distance number for free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377310,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the home node still\nbelieved it was connected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379770,
    "dDurationMs": 1803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a toll-free number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383040,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The vulnerabilities in the\nsignaling system were obvious"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386250,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to mimic the 2600 hertz tone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388890,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people would even use a toy whistle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391290,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from a Cap'n Crunch cereal box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393840,
    "dDurationMs": 2664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just happened to make that frequency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396504,
    "dDurationMs": 2226,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(whistle blowing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398730,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The telephone companies clearly needed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400740,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to develop a new signaling protocol"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403050,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and their solution was to\nuse a separate digital line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406290,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for carrying control signals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408360,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That way no one could control the network"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410580,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by sending tones down the voice line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413190,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it no longer controlled\nhow the call was connected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417300,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This new protocol was called\nSignaling System no. 7"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420960,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or SS7 for short."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422700,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's still broadly in use today,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425790,
    "dDurationMs": 3063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it may not be as\nsecure as people thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430080,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hello, my name is Latifa Al Maktoum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432600,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was born-\n- Princess Latifa"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433740,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Dubai claimed that her\nfather Sheikh Mohammed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436440,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ruling emir had held\nher in solitary confinement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438930,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the dark, beaten and\nsedated for several years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442470,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In late February, 2018,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444420,
    "dDurationMs": 3663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "her Finnish martial arts\ninstructor Tiina helped her escape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449070,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They fled to a yacht captain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450660,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by former French intelligence\nofficer, Hervé Jaubert."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454080,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for eight days they\nsailed toward India."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457770,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Latifa was hopeful but it wasn't to last."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461490,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Late on the night of March\n4th a dark boat pulled up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464280,
    "dDurationMs": 2823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "alongside it was sent by her father."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468420,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Laser cites pierced the smoke\nas agents boarded the yacht,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471840,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "abducting Latifa and\ntaking her back to Dubai."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478050,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how did they find her?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480540,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well the captain had been the victim"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482910,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a coordinated SS7 attack,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485340,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one aiming to pinpoint his location"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487590,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and by extension the\nwhereabouts of the princess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491010,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm going to show you how\nusing the exact same steps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495300,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to spy on my friends with\ntheir permission of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499830,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Karsten Nohl and\nAlexandre De Oliveira."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503730,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are cybersecurity specialists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505470,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who are helping me spy on Linus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507690,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We took three steps to spy on him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510390,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First you have to infiltrate SS7,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512880,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "second gain trust and third attack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517140,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, the main reason\nany of this is possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519180,
    "dDurationMs": 1083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is step one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522270,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When SS7 was introduced in 1980,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524760,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mobile phones barely existed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526890,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were so big that\nthey were mainly just used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529320,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as car phones but things changed quickly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532800,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the number of mobile\nphones in the world exploded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539850,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Roaming is one of the\nmain use cases of SS7."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542940,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say Derek, you visit me over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545400,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your phone would try to connect\nto a network that's foreign"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549660,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that network would\nthen have to reach out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552390,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to your home network in Australia asking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555600,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is this a valid customer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557430,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you willing to pay for the charges"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559260,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they'll incur on my network?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561180,
    "dDurationMs": 2793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And all of that information\nis exchanged over SS7."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566100,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- For this to work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567300,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "telcos need to communicate\nwith each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570030,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the way they do that is\nby making sure they're part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572910,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the same club."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574770,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way they share membership to this club"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576630,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is by using unique addresses to identify"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579210,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where requests are coming from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581370,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- SS7 is a global network,\njust like the internet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584100,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and like on the internet you\nneed some addressing scheme."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587220,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you need some way of saying\nthis is me and this is you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590430,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on the internet we use IP addresses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593040,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On SS7 we use what's\ncalled Global Titles, GTs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597480,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So to provide\nglobal roaming coverage,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599640,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "telcos typically establish agreements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601500,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with two providers in\neach country they serve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604020,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One primary and one backup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606300,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Telcos generally accept\nmessages only from Global Titles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609150,
    "dDurationMs": 1713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with which they have agreements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611910,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the whole system is\ndesigned to be a closed network"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614820,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with few barriers once inside,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617190,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is known as the\nwalled garden approach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620760,
    "dDurationMs": 3393,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this system seems\npretty secure and it was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626550,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When SS7 was developed in the '80s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628650,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the telecommunications\nlandscape was dominated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630840,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by a few large reputable operators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633450,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These operators had\nestablished relationships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635700,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and mutual interest in maintaining"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637500,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the integrity of the network."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639870,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But 45 years on the landscape\nhas shifted dramatically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643770,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now there are over 1200 operators"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646380,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 4,500 networks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648810,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "many of which need SS7 access\nfrom virtual network operators"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653160,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to mass-text services sending\nUber Eats notifications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657180,
    "dDurationMs": 3359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are so many more players\nin the garden that not all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660539,
    "dDurationMs": 1744,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of them are trustworthy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664380,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Those companies, some of them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667410,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sell services onto third parties,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670170,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some of them can be bribed,\nsome of them can be hacked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672840,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's probably thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674580,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of ways into SS7 at\nreasonable effort or cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678900,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How much are we talking\nlike how much would it cost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681930,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to buy access to SS7?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684240,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Buying a single SS7\nconnection isn't that expensive?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687420,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're talking a few\nthousand dollars per month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690750,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The people who do sell access,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692550,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, why would they do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694470,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- People sell SS7 for one reason money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697950,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And thanks to global agreements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699330,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between providers accessing a trusted GT"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702000,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is like gaining access to all the GTs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704760,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have partnerships with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706350,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We even saw the invoice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707820,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a valuable US-based\nGT being leased illegally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711450,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for $13,000 a month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714150,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you buying access to SS7?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716010,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm paying for access to SS7. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717900,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we do that because\nwe do SS7 security tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722430,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we need to be in a similar\nposition as real hackers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726450,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get near real results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729690,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So step one, infiltrate SS7 is complete."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733290,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Onto step two, gain trust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735840,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hackers today can try\nmany different things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737970,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once they've scaled the\nwall into the garden."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740490,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you need more than just SS7 access"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743160,
    "dDurationMs": 1653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a phone number to attack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745650,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even a trusted GT and the\nphone number of the target"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748410,
    "dDurationMs": 2523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "isn't enough to uniquely identify them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751860,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you need something from the SIM card."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754200,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The real key in a mobile network"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756060,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a unique 15 digit identifier\nwhich belongs exclusively"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760200,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the SIM card on the phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762150,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's called an international\nmobile subscriber identity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765480,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or IMSI for short."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767310,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is very important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770400,
    "dDurationMs": 2577,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Basically to be able to collect the IMSI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772977,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from a subscriber,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775110,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we would launch some of the messages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777600,
    "dDurationMs": 1798,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such as send routing info"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779398,
    "dDurationMs": 955,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or send routing info for SM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781890,
    "dDurationMs": 4203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These messages are normally\nused to collect the IMSI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787230,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Networks have firewalls in place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788910,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will deny some requests\nif they look suspicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791790,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Getting an IMSI is\ncrucial to appear trusted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795000,
    "dDurationMs": 2913,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's move on to the\ncritical step three, attack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799530,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you wanna just like try the phone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800970,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there anything you can\ntry to see if it works?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802590,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like call someone.\n- Sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803580,
    "dDurationMs": 2693,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Or text someone?\n- Sure. I'll call my wife."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807300,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- She normally pick up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808680,
    "dDurationMs": 2446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, she'll probably pick up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811126,
    "dDurationMs": 944,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Yvonne] Hello?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812070,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hello Yvonne, this is\nthe voice of your husband."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817080,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would like to talk to\nyou about the payment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822720,
    "dDurationMs": 843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, thanks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824400,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No, no, it's me. It's me.(laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827220,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Did she hang up on you?\n- Yeah, yeah, she did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829650,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we've established the phone works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831060,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a completely normal phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832620,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Do you have any\nimportant calls coming up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834810,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I don't know if I'd say it's important,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836130,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm on my way to\nCreator Summit tonight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838170,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and James from Hacksmith was gonna call me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840480,
    "dDurationMs": 1765,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when we're gonna kind of make some plans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842245,
    "dDurationMs": 1385,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(phone rings)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843630,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm getting a call right\nnow. Are you getting a call?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846660,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848910,
    "dDurationMs": 2075,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hello, this is Linus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850985,
    "dDurationMs": 2365,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [James] Hey Linas, it's\nJames. How's it going?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853350,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's going really well. How are you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855720,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [James] Pretty good. Am I\ngonna see the YouTube summit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859050,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes, I'm really looking forward to that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861180,
    "dDurationMs": 1503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And man, do I hate Macs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864330,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I feel like that's your persona man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866700,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't game on a Mac.\nLinus, you wanna talk?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870900,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I would like to talk but\nI never got the call, so..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876390,
    "dDurationMs": 1443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What number did you dial?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879077,
    "dDurationMs": 4543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [James] 4473.(beep)\n- Is that your number, Linus?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883620,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, but I didn't get,\nmine didn't even ring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887490,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I heard it ring but I heard it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889440,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through my speakers on my computer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890970,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'Cause I assume it went\nto your phone then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893310,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's right.\n- [Linas] Or did it go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894143,
    "dDurationMs": 1027,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to your computer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895170,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No. Yeah, it went to everything of mine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897600,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So yeah, James, I don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900480,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You called Linus and it went to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902520,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you for taking part\nin this weird demonstration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906600,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There is absolutely\nnothing here to indicate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910470,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I was supposed to receive a call."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912960,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, and I mean the crazy thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914700,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that's like a regular\nCanadian SIM card in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917490,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So any Canadian SIM card in\ntheory could be vulnerable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921540,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to such an attack where you\nknow, someone dials your number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924930,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it just doesn't go to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926490,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is like phreaking but on\na completely different level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930960,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's exactly it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932460,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now I'm familiar already with\nthe concept of SIM swapping"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936150,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you social engineer\na way to get a SIM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940560,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is registered to\nsomeone else's account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942180,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've actually had accounts\nstolen that way in the past,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944940,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in this case my phone still works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949050,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Yvonne] Hello?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949883,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hey, so the demo we're\ndoing is pretty trippy hun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954270,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Basically they had Hacksmith call me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957300,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my phone didn't ring at all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958920,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and instead Derek from Veritasium\npicked up the phone call"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962940,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and was able to talk to him\nand Hacksmith had no idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967020,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that he called me and then-\n- [Yvonne] Sorry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968880,
    "dDurationMs": 1112,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm with Cindy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969992,
    "dDurationMs": 1583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh. Oh, hi Cindy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972657,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Yvonne] Oh, you're not on speaker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973950,
    "dDurationMs": 2046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, that's fine. Just\ntell Cindy hi for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975996,
    "dDurationMs": 864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Yvonne] Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976860,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, goodbye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978660,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So how are we\nable to seize control"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980790,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Linus number like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982650,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When you put a phone\nnumber in your address book,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985140,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you often don't put the country code,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987540,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then if you're in a roaming scenario,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989820,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that phone number would connect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990900,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a completely different person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992250,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the country you're currently in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993960,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it does make sense to basically\noverrule people's choices"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998340,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as to whom they're trying to dial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000260,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they're not gonna\ntriple check each time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002810,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether the address book entries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004130,
    "dDurationMs": 1473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have country codes in them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006740,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is a powerful function"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009050,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by tricking the network into\nthinking his phone is roaming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012380,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can rewrite the number\nhe is calling to a number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015200,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017390,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And so what I did at the\nend was when I received"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019820,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this message, I sent back your\nnumber that you can see here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025910,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was your US based number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029480,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So even if you were located in Australia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032120,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was still able to\nforward the call to you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036440,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on your US number in Australia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039290,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040123,
    "dDurationMs": 2737,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just try a few times\nand then it works, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042860,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes, it's not always\nthat simple,(laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047090,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this time it was quite difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050630,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So the most important\nquestion I have now then is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054020,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what did you need to steal from me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056870,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to become me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059480,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like is this something\nyou can social engineer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061400,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of my carrier?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062690,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is this something that I would need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064670,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to accidentally leak a\nscreenshot of my IMEI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068000,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- At the very simplest, all we would need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070460,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is your phone number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071630,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072463,
    "dDurationMs": 2617,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could even do\nsomething where I could act"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075080,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a middleman where I would\nreroute the call to me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079460,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also simultaneously I would\ndial for you the real number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083030,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I would send you through to them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084830,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I can sit on the line\nand just record that call."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089180,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yikes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090320,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But this isn't the only attack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092600,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can do a lot more with SS7."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095120,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can also intercept text\nmessages as part of our suite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098300,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of attacks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099140,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similar to phone calls,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100310,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can trick the network\ninto thinking the target"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102530,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is roaming, which reroutes\ntheir messages to our GT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106730,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can then steal one time passwords"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108920,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "used in two factor authentication."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111320,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This type of attack works\nuntil the subscriber interacts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114110,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with their phone network,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115310,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at which point the phone\nreconnects to the correct GT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119180,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But you need a few seconds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120470,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only to hack into somebody's account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122120,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course you need that few second window"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124220,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to receive the one time password."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126710,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So we actually set up a\nnew Linus YouTube channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130250,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, so theoretically\nhe could get this username"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1133310,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and password via a dump\nbecause I'm a butthead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138290,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I use the same username"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139400,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and password across different accounts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141860,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or he could install a\nkey logger on my system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144680,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could get it that way\nwhen I'm typing it in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146900,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then I verify my number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149030,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But of course he has my number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150890,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because that's realistically\nnot that hard to find."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153950,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And theoretically I'm supposed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155240,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get a two factor\ncode right now except..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158960,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I got it, 820299, I'm in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165050,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Linas] He's in. He hacked\nthe mainframe. Wild hey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168470,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yep, we could hack your YouTube account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171170,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna put, I'm gonna\nstart posting science videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173450,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on Linus Tech Tips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175220,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, that's okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176053,
    "dDurationMs": 2047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure they'll get like 30\nmillion views or whatever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178100,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'll be fine with it.\nThanks for the AdSense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1180399,
    "dDurationMs": 1241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Derek laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181640,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183530,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you could see the code right there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1185480,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Alexandre] Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186313,
    "dDurationMs": 2777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you could see that at\nthe at the bottom. 820299."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191180,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So basically once the\ninterception is running,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194720,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I would receive any SMS sent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198350,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- He would never have known\nthat he missed those messages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201080,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or that they were intercepts.\n- Exact, exact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204530,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Wow. Yeah, this seems pretty serious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1208460,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, SMS two-factor authentication"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210170,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is almost the default, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211820,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Unfortunately, yes,\nit's not only the default"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215390,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in some cases it is\nthe only available option"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218540,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sometimes that can\neven be for accounts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220880,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that should be treated with the utmost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223730,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of care like a bank account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1225890,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] There's a third method of attack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227300,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we weren't able to show Linus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229040,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lucky for him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229873,
    "dDurationMs": 2257,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his network blocked the requests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232130,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On many networks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233000,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can use the IMSI number\nin the switching center info"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235640,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we harvested in step two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237200,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to send a command deeper into the network."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239930,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By targeting the switching\ncenter where the device"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241730,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the IMSI is connected,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242900,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can issue a command routinely used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1245000,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for legitimate purposes such\nas routing and forwarding calls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248390,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or providing emergency services based"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250370,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the device's location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252170,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Using this request we can\ntrack a target's location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255530,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not as hard as you'd think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257750,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "SS7 doesn't even rely on\nGPS to locate someone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260870,
    "dDurationMs": 4113,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, it was invented before\nGPS was even in public use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266480,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One way to do this is\nif a target is in range"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269120,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of multiple cell towers, their\nlocation can be narrowed down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272060,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to where the signals overlap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1273860,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more towers in range, the\nmore precise the location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277490,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A more accurate method\nmeasures the time it takes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1280100,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for signals to reach a\nphone from three towers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283460,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By calculating the distance\nbased on transmission speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286460,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can pinpoint an exact\nlocation on a 2D plane,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289940,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but SS7 attacks don't use\neither of these methods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1293090,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They try to be subtle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294800,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An SS7 location request simply\nidentifies the cell tower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1298100,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the target is connected to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300560,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In an urban area with many towers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1302480,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this can place them to\nwithin a hundred meters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305690,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You'll definitely know which\ncity block somebody is in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1307970,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you wanted to, for\ninstance find out was it at home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311420,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and or at work, this is\na great way to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314390,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, it's a little bit scary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1318200,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2016, Karsten and his\nteam used this method"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1321020,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to track US Congressman Ted Lieu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1323510,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The congressman has been in California,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327470,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more specifically the LA area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329540,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's zoom in here a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331160,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So that is how we did it.\nWe executed three steps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335120,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We infiltrated SS7,\ngained trust and attacked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339170,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We intercepted Linus phone\ncalls and text messages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1342710,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure he was as\nexcited about it as I was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345830,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is why we can't have nice things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1348500,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Up until now, this has\njust been a bit of fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350840,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've demonstrated these\nattacks on a friend of mine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353390,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the threats are real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355310,
    "dDurationMs": 3187,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can have\ndevastating consequences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358497,
    "dDurationMs": 1073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"They will kill her.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359570,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The captain texted shortly\nbefore Latifa was abducted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362900,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His phone was the target of an SS7 attack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365180,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that involved all three\nof the steps we explored."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368180,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To start, the attackers\nhad leased multiple GTs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1370910,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in different countries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372200,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the following all happened\nin a five minute window."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375530,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First they sent at least\nseven separate requests aiming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1378680,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get the captain's IMSI\nfrom his US based operator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382310,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When that didn't seem to\nwork, they followed up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384530,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with at least four location requests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387290,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So did it work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390050,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, all of these requests\nwere blocked by firewalls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392900,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why we have all the details."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395030,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there was a sixth GT we haven't shown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398180,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one nearby in the US,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400580,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we have no information about\nthe requests on this GT"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403520,
    "dDurationMs": 2523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they likely weren't stopped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407600,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We spoke with Crofton Black,\nthe investigative journalist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410360,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who revealed the SS7\nexploits in this story"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413360,
    "dDurationMs": 2077,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is what he told us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415437,
    "dDurationMs": 2963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"It's a brilliant example\nof SS7 involvement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418400,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it illustrates a\nclassic sophisticated pattern"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421580,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of attack, multiple GTs\nand multiple countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424790,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a textbook example of\ntelco penetration risks.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428450,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Though, because the Emiratis\nwere also using other software"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431750,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Pegasus and other\nhardware like spotter planes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1434900,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can't say that any single\none of these was the thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438890,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that led to her being found."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1440930,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the evidence is damning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1443030,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and SS7 is used pretty widely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446150,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Criminals have used SS7"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447560,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to intercept SMS two-factor\nauthentication codes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450410,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and empty millions of\ndollars from bank accounts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1453410,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For some SS7 is just the first step."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456440,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The NSO Group,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457610,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a notorious Israeli cyber\nsurveillance firm acquired"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460700,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an SS7 tracking company in 2014."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464150,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NSO is the company behind\nPegasus, a spyware tool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467090,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that gains complete access"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468380,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to targeted phones without\na user clicking anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471560,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "embedding itself and\nerasing traces of entry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474620,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Such zero click hacks are costly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477620,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can cost more than\n$4 million per exploit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1480500,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before NSO commits resources\ntargeting specific software"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483770,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or vulnerabilities on a phone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485450,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first they gather basic\ndata like device type"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1488210,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and software version to\nmake their lives easier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491480,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as you've seen with\nSS7, this isn't hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1495380,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One expert we spoke to\ntested a foreign network"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497960,
    "dDurationMs": 978,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and found 20"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498938,
    "dDurationMs": 4002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 30 VIPs were constantly\nunder surveillance there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502940,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including the country's\nchief of cybersecurity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506240,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Accurate data on tracking\nis difficult to come by,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508940,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but another expert provided\nevidence of more than two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511730,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a half million\ntracking attempts per year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1515090,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Though they reminded us that\nthe people being targeted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1517190,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are generally those of\ninterest to state agencies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521060,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we couldn't find data\non interception attempts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1523880,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but luckily experts told\nus this is far less common."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528110,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So millions of malicious SS7\nrequests are sent each year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532430,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it used to be even worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1535040,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To request location over SS7,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1537410,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you used to be able to send a\ncommand without even knowing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540080,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the IMSI and the network\nwould just provide it to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1543140,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No questions asked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1544580,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The classical example is\nthe anytime interrogation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547610,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "request, which as the name already suggest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1550460,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is have a creepy command."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1553550,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't believe there's\never legitimate purpose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1555740,
    "dDurationMs": 2557,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for one network to send this command"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558297,
    "dDurationMs": 4553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to another network interrogating\nabout their customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562850,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Karsten Nohl"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563683,
    "dDurationMs": 2137,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and fellow security\nresearcher Tobias Engel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565820,
    "dDurationMs": 3417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exposed these vulnerabilities\npublicly in 2014."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569237,
    "dDurationMs": 3873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The SS7 research that\nwas disclosed in 2014"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573110,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was a wake up call to the industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1575420,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most people had heard\nrumors that SS7 tracking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578510,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and spying was possible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1580040,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they hadn't really\nseen hard evidence of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582710,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and especially how easy\nit is that ragtag gang"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1586040,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of hackers from Berlin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587720,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with very amateur means can do any type"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591260,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of SS7 hacking that they want."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1593750,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] After their conference,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594800,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all of the German telcos\nimmediately started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1597050,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "refusing these requests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598970,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Anytime integration is\nthe first SS7 command,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1601490,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everyone stopped because\nit was abused a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605780,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and never used constructively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607730,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is over 150 other\nmessages that need to be stopped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1612500,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well to make SS7 be completely secure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616220,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So if there are so\nmany ways to abuse SS7,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619430,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why haven't we gotten rid of it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621350,
    "dDurationMs": 2027,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, because it's the backbone of 2G"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1623377,
    "dDurationMs": 2083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 3G communications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1625460,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what if we phase out 2G and 3G?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1628310,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that has caused problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630980,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since 2018 cars in the EU are equipped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633710,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with mandatory emergency call buttons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635690,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that trigger in an accident."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637580,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They need a SIM card to\nwork and to cut costs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640130,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "guess what auto manufacturers are using."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642950,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643940,
    "dDurationMs": 2883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2G and 3G SIM cards using SS7."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647800,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You have to have that legacy support"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649850,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or when 4G connectivity drops,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1652430,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have absolutely nothing left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1653870,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dude, the number of times that\nI'm on 3G, not insignificant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1658850,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm in a metropolitan area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1661010,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What's surprising, of course,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1662270,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that there hasn't been a\nglobal push yet to replace SS7"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666050,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with one of the two newer\nversions of the technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1670730,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The latest of which that was introduced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672380,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with 5G seems pretty secure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1674990,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's now a problem of\nfirst mover disadvantage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679010,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So because of the network\neffects you get nothing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1681950,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of adopting a\ntechnology as the first guy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685100,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You wanna be the last\none when everyone else"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1687530,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is already connected and\nyou get the full benefit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690290,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from also joining the club."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692330,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So even though\nthe 5G signaling protocol"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1694610,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can stop the attacks\ncompletely and many networks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1697130,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are using 5G technology on their networks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1699770,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when routing calls between networks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702110,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "SS7 is still the de facto standard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705680,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You create a tremendous\namount of inertia to use a term"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709430,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's probably more your\nchannel than my channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711860,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That makes moving on extremely difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1715610,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So unless there are\nsome new major events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1718910,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that put this back on the public radar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721820,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it could be another 10,\n15, maybe even 20 years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724550,
    "dDurationMs": 3627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until SS7 networks are\nfinally switched off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728177,
    "dDurationMs": 3303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What's crazy is that we\nexploited these vulnerabilities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731480,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm just a YouTuber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1732890,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did have the help of some\nexcellent security researchers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736010,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm surprised at how easy it all is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738890,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now imagine if I had the\nbacking of a government."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741680,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a real problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1743540,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what can you do to protect\nyourself on the personal side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1746900,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as long as you have a SIM card?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1748430,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unfortunately there's not much you can do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1750350,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about location tracking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751880,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If possible, choose alternatives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753620,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to SMS based two-factor authentication."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1755840,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So messages can't be intercepted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758120,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Use an Authenticator\napp or hardware tokens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1761120,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you're worried about phone tapping,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1762920,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use encrypted internet\nbased calling services"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765440,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Signal or WhatsApp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1767360,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've been told this is mainly\nused on people of interest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1770360,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So should it really matter to you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772310,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- SS7 is a huge privacy intrusion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774890,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's this millions of\nabuse cases every single month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1778400,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether privacy intrusion is\na problem for individually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1781820,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of course as almost a\nphilosophical question, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784970,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody who grew up more\nin the Berlin tradition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1787610,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the Chaos Computer Club like myself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1790430,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "strongly beliefs that privacy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792860,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the ability to kind\nof form your own thoughts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797090,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without being observed is a\nprerequisite for democracy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800930,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But many other people would argue nothing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1804680,
    "dDurationMs": 2428,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to hide, nothing to fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807108,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(scrappy music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1811310,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Our technological world\nwill never be perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1814310,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the time we secure or replace SS7,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816980,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "vulnerabilities will\nalready have been found"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819290,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the new system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1820700,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but luckily there's an\neasy way to be ready"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1822890,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for whatever the future\nholds, build your knowledge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1825680,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and problem solving skills\na little bit every day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828620,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can start doing\nthat right now for free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831230,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with this video sponsor, Brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1833480,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant has thousands\nof interactive lessons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835970,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
